Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Content Digest

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect streaming SHA-256 transform over caller-supplied byte chunks and a separate revalidated structural binding to supplied stable regular-file metadata, without claiming physical byte origin, read order, or content stability.

